  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gift Entrepreneurship Training for African Youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Despite considerable economic progress across the world, poverty continues to pervade many areas in African countries due to bad infrastructure, poor good education, limited jobs, corruption and more.  Entrepreneurship training is often the only ladder for youth to climb out of poverty. Money4YOU creates bright futures by delivering culturally appropriate entrepreneurship training to 500 young people annually. This enables them to start businesses that solve local problems and create jobs.</narrative>
  </description>
